      "content": "I get the caution, but the marketing team's concern is that if we're too vague on the comfort side, we'll just look like every other generic on the shelf. The data does show a trend of better patient experience, right? If we frame it carefully around 'patient-centric relief' or something similar, can we still safely use the 'superior comfort' angle in the main campaign headers? We need this to land hard.",
